(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Mid-tier micro credit providing business loans from Rs. 50,000 to Rs. 5,00,000) Tj
T*
(for expanding micro business enterprises.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Micro-enterprises that have already commenced operations and need funds) Tj
T*
(   between Rs. 50,000 and Rs. 5,00,000 for business expansion or machinery) Tj
T*
(   acquisition.) Tj
T*
(2. Clean credit history and non-defaulter status.) Tj
T*
(3. Valid business registration or establishment proof \(GST / Shop & Est /) Tj
T*
(   Udyam\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Term loan or working capital overdraft from Rs. 50,000 to Rs. 5,00,000 without) Tj
T*
(   collateral.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 5.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam / GST Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. KYC of Promoters \(PAN, Aadhaar\)) Tj
T*
(3. Bank Statement \(last 6 months\)) Tj
T*
(4. Last 1-2 years Sales Tax / GST Returns or Financial accounts) Tj
T*
(5. Machinery/equipment supplier quotation \(if asset finance\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
